{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574950/extras/3c37505b8c4077111ea0aa26cc21b18b.avif?t=1745236104\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574950/extras_big/3c37505b8c4077111ea0aa26cc21b18b.avif?t=1745236104 width=800 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Univocity</strong></i><strong> is a short, 4K ready, cyberpunk visual novel wrapped in neon aesthetics with a lush atmospheric soundtrack, featuring a deep and emotional conversation between two people about taking down a global tech monopoly and the responsibility that it entails.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Max, a former engineer who turned fugitive, is headed to the top of tallest tower of Univocity\u2014an urban sprawl owned by \u014c\u1e41, a global tech monopoly\u2014to set off an electromagnetic pulse bomb that will plunge the city into a technological dark age. But their plans are disrupted when they encounter Nina, an \u014c\u1e41 employee, which sparks a conversation that makes them question their motives.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574950/extras/4acdfff27b04ee20cd6913fc537c113f.avif?t=1745236104\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574950/extras_big/4acdfff27b04ee20cd6913fc537c113f.avif?t=1745236104 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 30\u00a0minutes\u00a0of\u00a0interactive\u00a0gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep immersive atmospheric soundtrack by artists such\u00a0as\u00a0Patricia Taxxon,\u00a0Neurotech\u00a0and NeuroAxis.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A self-contained sci-fi story\u00a0that hints at\u00a0a larger\u00a0universe, with\u00a0themes\u00a0resonating\u00a0with\u00a0currents\u00a0events.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tries\u00a0to find\u00a0a\u00a0sweet\u00a0spot\u00a0between\u00a0dystopia\u00a0and hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching narratives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique backgrounds that use a blend of pixel art and algorithmic art (no\u00a0AI-generated stuff !)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic interactions between characters, based around dilemmas\u00a0and\u00a0responsibilities, as\u00a0well as\u00a0a\u00a0tinge\u00a0of\u00a0attraction.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574950?t=1745236104","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574950/bcb1cf99d6541e762e2eedabc4bb85226f0cac4b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745236104","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574950/d22f52eaf7858802a01eed0d2332707a39dfb14b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745236104","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574950/d22f52eaf7858802a01eed0d2332707a39dfb14b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745236104","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574950/extras/3c37505b8c4077111ea0aa26cc21b18b.avif?t=1745236104\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574950/extras_big/3c37505b8c4077111ea0aa26cc21b18b.avif?t=1745236104 width=800 height=229 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_pa